<title>UK: Merrill lynch sets warrants on Sulzer AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill lynch sets warrants on Sulzer AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich said it has issued 12 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Sulzer AG registered shares.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> FIFTY WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.     PAY DATE     19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     SWISS EXCHANGE	MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    940 CHF</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>	  MATURITY     STRIKE     ISSUE	PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p>	  18.SEP.98    1000 CHF   1.90 CHF   16.58 PCT  9.80 X</p>
<p>	  21.JAN.00    1100 CHF   2.20 CHF   28.72 PCT  8.54 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
